.","values":{"ar-001":"قاعدتك مُعلَّمة بشعاع سماوي.","de-de":"Deine Basis ist mit einem cyanfarbenen Strahl markiert.","es-mx":"Tu base está marcada con un rayo cian.","fr-fr":"Ta base est indiquée par un rayon cyan.","ja-jp":"あなたの拠点はシアンの光で示されています。","pt-br":"Sua base está marcada com um feixe ciano."}},{"key":"base.owned_by","context":"Sign above another player's base. {name} is a Roblox display name.","source":"{name}'s base","values":{"ar-001":"قاعدة {name}","de-de":"Basis von {name}","es-mx":"Base de {name}","fr-fr":"Base de {name}","ja-jp":"{name}の拠点","pt-br":"Base de {name}"}},{"key":"base.vacant","context":"Sign above an unassigned base plot.","source":"Free base slot","values":{"ar-001":"مكان قاعدة فارغ","de-de":"Freier Basisplatz","es-mx":"Espacio de base libre","fr-fr":"Emplacement de base libre","ja-jp":"空いている拠点","pt-br":"Espaço de base livre"}},{"key":"base.yours","context":"Sign above the local player's own base plot.","source":"Your base","values":{"ar-001":"قاعدتك","de-de":"Deine Basis","es-mx":"Tu base","fr-fr":"Ta base","ja-jp":"あなたの拠点","pt-br":"Sua base"}},{"key":"error.inventory_full","context":"No automatic item destruction.","source":"Your collection is full. Make room before capturing.","values":{}},{"key":"error.portal_cooldown","context":"Portal rate limit.","source":"Please wait a moment before using the portal again.","values":{}},{"key":"error.portal_locked","context":"Portal for a locked or unbuilt zone.","source":"This zone is not available yet.","values":{}},{"key":"error.portal_too_far","context":"Portal request from too far away.","source":"Move closer to the portal.","values":{}},{"key":"error.server_failed","context":"Server initialization failed; gameplay is blocked.","source":"Something went wrong while starting. Please rejoin.","values":{}},{"key":"error.server_starting","context":"Client waiting for the server ready signal.","source":"The server is still starting. Please wait.","values":{}},{"key":"error.translation_fallback","context":"Honest note when a translation is missing for the player's language.","source":"Some text is shown in English.","values":{"ar-001":"بعض النصوص معروضة باللغة الإنجليزية.","de-de":"Einige Texte werden auf Englisch angezeigt.","es-mx":"Algunos textos se muestran en inglés.","fr-fr":"Certains textes sont affichés en anglais.","ja-jp":"一部のテキストは英語で表示されます。","pt-br":"Alguns textos são exibidos em inglês."}},{"key":"error.travel_failed","context":"Portal fallback after a timeout.","source":"Travel failed. You are back in a safe place.","values":{}},{"key":"evolution.requirement","context":"Parameterized evolution requirement.","source":"Extract this species {count} times.","values":{}},{"key":"hint.dismiss","context":"Button that hides an onboarding hint.","source":"Got it","values":{"ar-001":"فهمت","de-de":"Verstanden","es-mx":"Entendido","fr-fr":"Compris","ja-jp":"OK","pt-br":"Entendi"}},{"key":"hint.move_gamepad","context":"Movement hint on gamepads. No button names: they differ between controller brands.","source":"Use the left stick to move and the jump button to jump.","values":{}},{"key":"hint.move_keyboard","context":"Key names are filled in for the player's keyboard layout.","source":"Move with {up} {left} {down} {right}. Jump with {jump}.","values":{}},{"key":"hint.move_touch","context":"Movement hint on touch devices.","source":"Use the thumbstick to move and the jump button to jump.","values":{"ar-001":"استخدم عصا التحكم للتحرك وزر القفز للقفز.","de-de":"Benutze den Stick zum Laufen und die Sprungtaste zum Springen.","es-mx":"Usa el joystick para moverte y el botón de salto para saltar.","fr-fr":"Utilise le joystick pour te déplacer et le bouton de saut pour sauter.","ja-jp":"スティックで移動し、ジャンプボタンでジャンプします。","pt-br":"Use o direcional para se mover e o botão de pulo para pular."}},{"key":"info.safe_collection","context":"Ownership explanation.","source":"Your secured collection is safe.","values":{}},{"key":"objective.explore_zone","context":"Shown on arrival in an expedition zone during the first build (capture arrives in a later update).","source":"Look around. Anomalies live in this zone.","values":{"ar-001":"انظر حولك. تعيش الشذوذات في هذه المنطقة.","de-de":"Sieh dich um. In dieser Zone leben Anomalien.","es-mx":"Mira a tu alrededor. En esta zona viven anomalías.","fr-fr":"Regarde autour de toi. Des anomalies vivent dans cette zone.","ja-jp":"周りを見てみよう。このゾーンにはアノマリーがいる。","pt-br":"Olhe ao redor. Anomalias vivem nesta zona."}},{"key":"objective.first_capture","context":"First objective shown in the HUD.","source":"Bring your first anomaly home.","values":{"ar-001":"أحضر أول شذوذ لك إلى المنزل.","de-de":"Bring deine erste Anomalie nach Hause.","es-mx":"Lleva tu primera anomalía a casa.","fr-fr":"Ramène ta première anomalie à la maison.","ja-jp":"最初のアノマリーを持ち帰ろう。","pt-br":"Leve sua primeira anomalia para casa."}},{"key":"objective.go_to_portal","context":"Onboarding hint in the hub before the first expedition.","source":"Walk to the glowing portal to start your first expedition.","values":{"ar-001":"امشِ إلى البوابة المضيئة لبدء رحلتك الاستكشافية الأولى.","de-de":"Geh zum leuchtenden Portal, um deine erste Expedition zu starten.","es-mx":"Camina hacia el portal brillante para comenzar tu primera expedición.","fr-fr":"Marche jusqu'au portail lumineux pour commencer ta première expédition.","ja-jp":"光るポータルまで歩いて、最初の探索を始めよう。","pt-br":"Vá até o portal brilhante para começar sua primeira expedição."}},{"key":"portal.not_available","context":"Sign on a dormant portal for a zone that is not built yet.","source":"Not available yet","values":{"ar-001":"غير متاح بعد","de-de":"Noch nicht verfügbar","es-mx":"Aún no disponible","fr-fr":"Pas encore disponible","ja-jp":"まだ利用できません","pt-br":"Ainda não disponível"}},{"key":"portal.to_area","context":"Proximity prompt object text. {area} is a localized area name.","source":"Portal: {area}","values":{"ar-001":"بوابة: {area}","de-de":"Portal: {area}","es-mx":"Portal: {area}","fr-fr":"Portail : {area}","ja-jp":"ポータル：{area}","pt-br":"Portal: {area}"}},{"key":"portal.to_hub","context":"Return portal object text.","source":"Portal: Research Hub","values":{"ar-001":"بوابة: مركز الأبحاث","de-de":"Portal: Forschungszentrum","es-mx":"Portal: Centro de Investigación","fr-fr":"Portail : Centre de recherche","ja-jp":"ポータル：研究ハブ","pt-br":"Portal: Centro de Pesquisa"}},{"key":"settings.reduced_motion","context":"Accessibility toggle.","source":"Reduced motion","values":{}},{"key":"sign.arrival","context":"World sign at the safe arrival pad of a zone.","source":"Arrival point","values":{"ar-001":"نقطة الوصول","de-de":"Ankunftspunkt","es-mx":"Punto de llegada","fr-fr":"Point d'arrivée","ja-jp":"到着ポイント","pt-br":"Ponto de chegada"}},{"key":"sign.extraction","context":"World sign at an extraction zone.","source":"Extraction point","values":{"ar-001":"نقطة الاستخراج","de-de":"Extraktionspunkt","es-mx":"Punto de extracción","fr-fr":"Point d'extraction","ja-jp":"脱出ポイント","pt-br":"Ponto de extração"}},{"key":"sign.welcome","context":"Large sign in the hub center.","source":"Welcome, researcher","values":{"ar-001":"مرحبًا أيها الباحث","de-de":"Willkommen, Forscher","es-mx":"Bienvenido, investigador","fr-fr":"Bienvenue, chercheur","ja-jp":"ようこそ、研究員","pt-br":"Bem-vindo, pesquisador"}},{"key":"species.fridge_dog.description","context":"Creature description.","source":"Its cold breath makes the ground slippery.","values":{}},{"key":"species.fridge_dog.name","context":"Creature name. A small dog whose body is a refrigerator.","source":"Fridge Dog","values":{}},{"key":"species.glitch_pigeon.description","context":"Creature description.","source":"A pigeon that sometimes slips sideways through space.","values":{}},{"key":"species.glitch_pigeon.name","context":"Creature name. Gray pigeon with one segmented violet wing.","source":"Glitch Pigeon","values":{}},{"key":"species.siren_toad.description","context":"Creature description.","source":"Its loud call alerts nearby guardians.","values":{}},{"key":"species.siren_toad.name","context":"Creature name. Green toad with a speaker-like throat.","source":"Siren Toad","values":{}},{"key":"status.expedition_area","context":"HUD badge while inside an expedition zone.","source":"Expedition area","values":{"ar-001":"منطقة استكشاف","de-de":"Expeditionsgebiet","es-mx":"Zona de expedición","fr-fr":"Zone d'expédition","ja-jp":"探索エリア","pt-br":"Área de expedição"}},{"key":"status.loading","context":"Shown while the game starts.","source":"Loading...","values":{"ar-001":"جارٍ التحميل...","de-de":"Wird geladen...","es-mx":"Cargando...","fr-fr":"Chargement...","ja-jp":"読み込み中...","pt-br":"Carregando..."}},{"key":"status.safe_area","context":"HUD badge: no PvP or cargo theft here.","source":"Safe area","values":{"ar-001":"منطقة آمنة","de-de":"Sicherer Bereich","es-mx":"Zona segura","fr-fr":"Zone sûre","ja-jp":"安全エリア","pt-br":"Área segura"}},{"key":"status.saving","context":"Persistence not yet confirmed.","source":"Saving your anomaly...","values":{}},{"key":"status.secured","context":"Display only after confirmed ownership.","source":"Anomaly secured!","values":{}},{"key":"status.traveling","context":"Shown during a portal transition.","source":"Traveling...","values":{"ar-001":"جارٍ الانتقال...","de-de":"Unterwegs...","es-mx":"Viajando...","fr-fr":"Voyage en cours...","ja-jp":"移動中...","pt-br":"Viajando..."}},{"key":"warning.risk_zone","context":"Before entering a PvP area.","source":"Unsecured cargo can be stolen here.","values":{}}]</string>
